    "identifier": "shoton-crystal-release-crystal-prison",
    "description": "<p>You release a wave of crystal particles in the air, allowing them to build upon all creatures in the area, encasing them in a pillar of crystal.  crystalline structure, completely encasing a creature you touch within.</p>\n<p>All creatures of your choice within range, must make a Charisma saving throw. On a failure, they gain 1 rank of Crystallization. If they failed their saving throw by 5 or more, they instead gain 2 ranks.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above B-Rank, increase the cost of this jutsu by 3. If this jutsu is cast at S-Rank, on a failure, creatures instead gain +1 ranks of Crystallization.</p>",
